# devbox project contract for Orion (sourced by the devbox `build` command).
#
# Toolchain (.devbox/provision.sh): JDK 21 + Flutter (stable) + Android SDK
#   (platform android-34, build-tools 34.0.0), installed into the /opt/toolchain volume.
# Build targets (devbox discovers .devbox/build-<target>.sh):
#   build web   -> .devbox/build-web.sh : flutter build web   -> $SERVE_DIR/web/   (no Android)
#   build apk   -> .devbox/build-apk.sh : flutter build apk   -> $SERVE_DIR/apk/ (versioned + index; needs Android SDK)
#   build       -> both (each independent — apk failing never blocks web)
# Recommended PROJECT_BRANCH: phase-1-map (set it in devbox.conf).
